          "title": "Checkpoint hygiene authority exceeds the approved EOF-only Explore proof",
          "problem": "214/215 approved Explore Proof 5 proves only a bounded EOF normalization after real OpenSpec 1.7 archive: collapse redundant EOF blank lines and preserve exactly one final newline. The Explore in-scope boundary likewise says EOF-only terminal whitespace normalization, and its Evidence/Gap explicitly says no evidence supports broad formatting authority. 216 Proposal, Design Decision 6, flowkit-archive-and-checkpoint-boundary spec, and task 4.2 expand the same Owner checkpoint authorization to also remove trailing spaces/tabs from touched text files. That additional transformation class was not established by the approved Explore evidence.",
          "contractRef": "Flowkit Explore Skill v2 §4.7 External Mutation Proof / §5 Proof Acceptance Depth / approved 214 Explore Proof 5",
