          "requiredOutcome": "Revise the Proposal generation so checkpoint normalization is limited to the approved EOF-only rule: collapse redundant EOF blank lines and ensure exactly one final newline on candidate/archive-touched text files, with semantic/internal formatting/unrelated-file changes fail-closed. Do not include trailing spaces/tabs removal unless that broader class is first supported by a new legitimate Explore proof/authority boundary.",
          "acceptance": [
            "Proposal/Design/spec/tasks no longer authorize generic trailing spaces/tabs removal under the existing checkpoint authorization.",
